        </h2>

        <div className="flex items-center text-xs text-stone-400 font-sans mt-4 border-t border-stone-100 pt-4">
          <span className="font-bold text-stone-700 mr-2 uppercase tracking-wide text-[10px]">{article.author}</span>
          <span className="mr-2 text-stone-300">•</span>
          <span className="italic font-serif text-stone-500">{article.source}</span>
